===Etymology===
[[mile]] + [[stone]]

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# One of a series of numbered markers placed along a road at regular intervals, typically at the side of the road or in a median.
# An [[important]] [[event]] in a person's [[life]] or [[career]], in the [[history]] of a [[nation]], or in the life of some [[project]]

